# On-device EmbeddingGemma 2 weights, token/position tables, and tokenizer —
# NOT committed. Too large for a lean public repo and would burn the Git-LFS
# bandwidth quota. Published as a checksummed GitHub Release asset and fetched
# into Vendor/ via Scripts/fetch-models.sh. The tiny Manifest.json companions
# and the license/NOTICE stay tracked. End users get these bundled in the DMG.
Vendor/embeddinggemma2/models/**/*.bin
Vendor/embeddinggemma2/models/**/*.mlmodel
Vendor/embeddinggemma2/resources/
Vendor/embeddinggemma2/tokenizer/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Secrets — never commit any of these.
# Defence-in-depth before Phase R (public repo).
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
secrets/
.secrets/
.gemini-api.key

# Internal / AI-authored planning + working docs — kept locally, never public.
